Error [E0109]: `+` can't compare or combine U8 (an 8-bit whole number, 0 to 255) and I8 (an 8-bit whole number, -128 to 127)
  --> tests/ui/int_width_mismatch.jet:4:12
    |
  4 |     sum :: a + b
    |            ^^^^^
 Why: neither U8 contains every value of I8, nor I8 every value of U8
 Fix: choose the result type and convert the other side into it
